  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463262",
      "title": "Understanding the Problem",
      "lectureOrder": 42,
      "videoOrder": 37,
      "sourceHash": "a588830d64d862c78d0a4163281eaac287acee3db30313dfa2b54d3b9bb02bdc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 4.63,
          "en": "So here's a little starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.63,
          "end": 6.32,
          "en": "with which I want to start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.32,
          "end": 8.92,
          "en": "And what exactly is the problem here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.92,
          "end": 13.5,
          "en": "What can we do with Vue to make this project better?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.5,
          "end": 17.86,
          "en": "Well, for one, my goal, no pun intended is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.86,
          "end": 22.15,
          "en": "we can add goals here, like finish the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.15,
          "end": 26.77,
          "en": "And when we then press add goal, currently nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.77,
          "end": 31.77,
          "en": "That goal should be added as a goal in a growing list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.08,
          "end": 35.49,
          "en": "If we have a look at the index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.49,
          "end": 37.55,
          "en": "of the starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.55,
          "end": 40.78,
          "en": "which by the way is attached to this lecture, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.78,
          "end": 43.68,
          "en": "then you see in there, I got an unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.68,
          "end": 47.29,
          "en": "with one dummy list item at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.29,
          "end": 51.67,
          "en": "And my goal is that the items we're entering here should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.67,
          "end": 53.87,
          "en": "added to this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.87,
          "end": 56.28,
          "en": "And we also should be able to then click",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.28,
          "end": 60.03,
          "en": "on those list items to remove them from the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.03,
          "end": 63.05,
          "en": "But that's just one thing which I want to implement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.05,
          "end": 64.46,
          "en": "with you in this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.46,
          "end": 68.39,
          "en": "And you will learn how that can be done with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.39,
          "end": 72.4,
          "en": "But for a start, I actually want to focus on something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.4,
          "end": 74.05,
          "en": "I have this message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.05,
          "end": 76.17,
          "en": "No goals have been added yet -",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.17,
          "end": 78.61,
          "en": "please start adding some.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.61,
          "end": 80.4,
          "en": "And at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.4,
          "end": 83.76,
          "en": "I'm rendering this unordered list with dummy goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.76,
          "end": 85.61,
          "en": "The dummy goal, because currently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.61,
          "end": 89.62,
          "en": "we have no way of outputting actual goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.62,
          "end": 92.72,
          "en": "If we have a look at the JavaScript file in the starting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.72,
          "end": 95.25999999999999,
          "en": "code, you see, I already created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.25999999999999,
          "end": 97.83,
          "en": "a very simple view app for you there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.83,
          "end": 101.65,
          "en": "which is connected to the DOM, and which has some data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.65,
          "end": 106.2,
          "en": "Though the data it does have is just a goals array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.2,
          "end": 108.663,
          "en": "with an empty array initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.5,
          "end": 113.59,
          "en": "And now here's my problem, which I want to solve with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.59,
          "end": 118.5,
          "en": "If this array is empty, as it initially is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.5,
          "end": 122.71,
          "en": "then this unordered list should not be shown,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.71,
          "end": 125.62,
          "en": "it should not be part of the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.62,
          "end": 129.09,
          "en": "and instead this paragraph should be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.09,
          "end": 132.13,
          "en": "On the apprehend, if we do have goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.13,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "because we added some here in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.82,
          "end": 139.09,
          "en": "or because later we added code to grow this list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.09,
          "end": 140.92000000000002,
          "en": "If we do have goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.92000000000002,
          "end": 144.15,
          "en": "then I want to show this unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.15,
          "end": 146.17000000000002,
          "en": "I want to render this in the DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.17000000000002,
          "end": 148.29,
          "en": "I want to include this in the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.29,
          "end": 151.243,
          "en": "and I don't want to show this paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.26,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "So we need conditional rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 159.24,
          "en": "And if you think about modern web applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.24,
          "end": 161.39,
          "en": "that is something you need a lot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.39,
          "end": 162.77,
          "en": "If you, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.77,
          "end": 166.94,
          "en": "have a web application that fetches data from a server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.94,
          "end": 169.87,
          "en": "you might want to show a loading spinner whilst you're",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.87,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "waiting for the data to arrive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 174.46,
          "en": "This is actually something we'll build together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.46,
          "end": 176.6,
          "en": "a little bit later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.6,
          "end": 180.37,
          "en": "So showing different content, conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.37,
          "end": 182.35,
          "en": "when certain conditions are met",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.35,
          "end": 186.74,
          "en": "is a typical problem you have in front-end web development,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.74,
          "end": 189.38,
          "en": "and Vue makes it easy for us to solve it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.38,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "Let's see how we can render a content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 193.793,
          "en": "conditionally with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
